'''Earl Fitzgerald Beecham''' (born September 8, 1965) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[running back]] for one season with the [[New York Giants]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Bucknell Bison football|Bucknell Bison]].

