'''Earl Leon Gant''' (born July 6, 1957) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[running back]] for the [[Kansas City Chiefs]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) . He played [[college football]] for the [[Missouri Tigers football|Missouri Tigers]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pjstar.com/article/20111101/NEWS/311019827|title=Where Are They Now: Earl Gant|website=Journal Star}}</ref> He also played professionally in the [[United States Football League]] (USFL) for the [[Birmingham Stallions]].
